{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["כזאת — likewise." "עשרה חמורים — for the ten brothers, and even though Binyamin returned with them he did not wish to burden him. We say in the Talmud: the curse of a sage, even if made on condition and the condition was fulfilled, still takes effect. How do we know this? From Yehudah, who even though he returned Binyamin to his father, his bones were rolled about in a coffin, etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:18.142949388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}